  "description": "Calculate the probability that a frog is at a specific target node after t seconds, starting from node 1.",
  "target": 4,
  "pseudocode": "1. queue = [{node: 1, prob: 1.0}]\n2. visited = {1}\n3. for time in 0 to t-1:\n4.   next_layer = []\n5.   for each {u, prob} in queue:\n6.     neighbors = adj[u] - visited\n7.     for v in neighbors:\n8.       next_layer.append({node: v, prob: prob / neighbors.length})\n9.   queue = next_layer\n10.  visited.add(all nodes in next_layer)\n11. return probability of target",
